{
  "title": "Last Night of Ramazan",
  "data": "Acts of the Night\nPerform ghusl tonight.\nVisit the tomb of Imam al-Husayn (a.s.).\nRecite [Surah al-An'am](A10), [Surah al-Kahf](A22) and [Surah Ya-Sin](A40).\nRecite 100 times:\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ وَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHA WA ATOOBU ILAYH\nI implore for Allah’s forgiveness and I repent before Him.\nBid farewell to the month of Ramazan with its farewell duas, such as al-Kulayni's [Farewell Prayer of Ramazan](AA47) and [Dua No. 45 of Sahifa al-Kamila](AA49), perhaps the best of them.",
  "tabs": [
    "Dua Allahumma Hadha Shahru Ramadan\nاَللّٰهُمَّ هٰذَا شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ الَّذِيْ اَنْزَلْتَ فِيْهِ الْقُرْاٰنَ وَقَدْ تَصَرَّمَ\nALLAAHUMMA HAADHAA SHAHRU RAMADAANAL LADHEE ANZALTA FEEHIL QUR'AANA WA QAD TASARRAM\nO Allah, this month of Ramadan in which You revealed the Qur'an is about to come to its end.\nوَاَعُوْذُ بِوَجْهِكَ الْكَرِيْمِ يَا رَبِّ اَنْ يَطْلُعَ الْفَجْرُ مِنْ لَيْلَتِيْ هٰذِهِ اَوْ يَتَصَرَّمَ شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ\nWA A'OODHU BIWAJHIKAL KAREEMI YAA RABBI AN YATLU'AL FAJRU MIN LAYLATEE HAADHIHEE AW YATASARRAMA SHAHRU RAMADAAN\nI seek refuge with Your Noble Face, O Lord, that it dawns tonight or the month of Ramadan elapses\nوَلَكَ قِبَلِيْ تَبِعَةٌ اَوْ ذَنْبٌ تُرِيْدُ اَنْ تُعَذِّبَنِيْ بِهٖ يَوْمَ اَلْقَاكَ\nWA LAKA QIBALEE TABI'ATUN AW DHANBUN TUREEDU AN TU'ADHDHIBANEE BIHEE YAWMA ALQAAK\nbut I am still liable to an offense or a sin that You want to punish me for committing it when I will meet You.",
    "Dua Ya Mudabbir al-Umur\nيَا مُدَبِّرَ الْاُمُوْرِ، يَا بَاعِثَ مَنْ فِي الْقُبُوْرِ\nYAA MUDABBIRAL UMOORI YAA BAA'ITHA MAN FIL QUBOOR\nO Director of all affairs! O Resurrector of all those in graves!\nيَا مُجْرِيَ الْبُحُوْرِ يَا مُلَيِّنَ الْحَدِيْدِ لِدَاوُدَ\nYAA MUJRIYAL BUHOORI YAA MULAYYINAL HADEEDI LIDAAWUD\nO He Who causes oceans to flow; O He Who made the iron pliant for (Prophet) David\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\n(Please) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَافْعَلْ بِي كَذا وَكَذا\nWAF'AL BEE KADHAA WA KADHAA\nAnd do for me (mention your legitimate desires)",
    "Short Farewell Duas\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا تَجْعَلْهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنْ صِيَامِيْ لِشَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAJ'ALHU AAKHIRAL A'HDI MIN SIYAAMEE LISHAHRI RAMADAAN\nO Allah, (please) do not decide my observance of fasting in this month of Ramadan to be the last of my observance of fasting.\nوَاَعُوْذُ بِكَ اَنْ يَطْلُعَ فَجْرُ هٰذِهِ اللَّيْلَةِ اِلَّا وَقَدْ غَفَرْتَ لِي\nWA A'OODHU BIKA AN YATLU'A FAJRU HAADHIHIL LAYLATI ILLAA WA QAD GHAFARTA LEE\nI seek Your protection against that this day dawns before You shall forgive me.\nOn the last Friday of Ramazan, bid it farewell with:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَا تَجْعَلْهُ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنْ صِيَامِنَا اِيَّاهُ\nALLAAHUMMA LAA TAJ'ALHU AAKHIRAL A'HDI MIN SIYAAMINAA IYYAAH\nO Allah, (please) do not make it the last of our fasting in this month\nفَاِنْ جَعَلْتَهٗ فَاجْعَلْنِيْ مَرْحُوْمًا وَلَا تَجْعَلْنِيْ مَحْرُوْمًا\nFA-IN JA'ALTAHOO FAJ'ALNEE MARHOOMAN WA LAA TAJ'ALNEE MAHROOMAA\nbut if You decide so, then (please) make me enjoy (Your) mercy and do not make me deprived (of it).",
    "Ten-Unit Prayer\nPray ten units, two at a time with tashahhud and salam. In each unit, after [Surah al-Fatihah](A5), recite [Surah al-Tawheed](A116) 10 times.\nIn each ruku' and sajdah, recite 10 times:\nسُبْحَانَ اللهِ وَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ وَلَآ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَاللهُ اَكْبَرُ\nSUBHAANALLAAHI WAL HAMDU LILLAAHI WA LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WALLAAHU AKBAR\nAll glory be to Allah, all praise be to Allah, there is no god save Allah, and Allah is the Greatest.\nAfter the last salam, recite 1,000 times:\nاَسْتَغْفِرُ اللهَ وَاَتُوْبُ اِلَيْهِ\nASTAGHFIRULLAAHA WA ATOOBU ILAYH\nI implore for Allah’s forgiveness and I repent before Him.\nThen go into sajdah and recite:\nيَا حَيُّ يَا قَيُّوْمُ، يَا ذَا الْجَلَالِ وَالْاِكْرَامِ\nYAA HAYYU YAA QAYYOOMU YAA DHAL JALAALI WAL IKRAAM\nO Ever-Alive! O Eternal! O Lord of Majesty and Honor!\nيَا رَحْمٰنَ الدُّنْيَا وَالْاٰخِرَةِ وَرَحِيْمَهُمَا\nYAA RAHMAANAD DUNYAA WAL AAKHIRATI WA RAHEEMAHUMAA\nO All-beneficent of this world and the Next World and the All-merciful of them!\nيَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِينَ، يَا اِلٰهَ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْاٰخِرِيْنَ\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEENA YAA ILAAHAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHIREEN\nO most Merciful of all those who show mercy! O God of the past and the coming generations!\nاِغْفِرْ لَنَا ذُنُوْبَنَا، وَتَقَبَّلْ مِنَّا صَلَاتَنَا وَصِيَامَنَا وَقِيَامَنَا\nIGHFIR LANAA DHUNOOBANAA WA TAQABBAL MINNAA SALAATANAA WA SIYAAMANAA WA QIYAAMANAA\n(Please) forgive us our sins and accept our prayers, fasting, and worship."
